[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0020","text":"甜花，你挺认真的嘛\n在玩游戏吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0030","text":"不是……\n在看抓娃娃机的视频……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0040","text":"哦哦，原来是在学习啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0050","text":"嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0060","text":"甜花……\n力气，不够……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0070","text":"为了救出恶魔太郎的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0080","text":"是、是这样啊\n……有什么我能帮上忙的吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0090","text":"……不用了，没事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_03_0100","text":"──这是，甜花的战斗……！"}]
